  (text "ECP5-25F CABGA-256 bank and supply units\nPerimeter-first I/O; target-powered rails and hardware interlock"
    (at 220.98 157.48 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "bc2de0a6-5316-5a28-b188-094ea3b03427"))
  (text "SIGNAL CONVENTIONS\nCPU_* / TGT_* = physical 5 V nets (never shorted together).\nFPGA_CPU_*_IN / FPGA_TGT_*_IN = 3.3 V sensed signals.\nFPGA_*_OUT = 3.3 V drive data; *_OE_N = active-low group enable.\nSignal nets use global labels; supplies use power symbols. _N means active low."
    (at 25.4 279.4 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "ffc75bfe-ffb1-5acf-a72d-89e9413fc7ac"))
  (text "DESIGN STILL TO COMPLETE\nValidate assigned FPGA I/O, timing and BGA footprint.\nValidate regulators, decoupling, hardware interlock and target power budget.\nFinish FTDI support and boot straps; review target timing and ERC.\nThis is a schematic starting point; no PCB or fabrication release."
    (at 215.9 279.4 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "ed9c87e8-1ea4-5717-927c-f7cee7a082e0"))
